---

<BaseLayout
  title={"Business IT Services in Austin, TX | Bleufoot Solutions"}
  description={"Explore managed IT, strategic consulting, cybersecurity, cloud infrastructure, and network services from Bleufoot Solutions in Austin, Texas."}
  canonical={"https://www.bleufoot.com/services"}
  robots={"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"}
  activePage="services"
  openGraph={{
    "title": "Business IT Services in Austin, TX | Bleufoot Solutions",
    "description": "Managed IT, strategic consulting, cybersecurity, cloud infrastructure, and network services for Austin businesses.",
    "url": "https://www.bleufoot.com/services",
    "image": "https://www.bleufoot.com/assets/img/og-image.png",
    "imageType": "image/png",
    "imageWidth": "1200",
    "imageHeight": "630",
    "imageAlt": "Bleufoot Solutions technology services"
  }}
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
<main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><h4>Services</h4></div><h1>Technology services that help you plan, build, secure, and grow.</h1><p>Bleufoot combines advisory thinking, engineering depth, proactive support, and practical cybersecurity into one technology partnership.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><ul><li>Strategy before spending</li><li>Support before disruption</li><li>Security before exposure</li><li>Documentation before confusion</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker"><h4>Service ecosystem</h4></div><h2>Five connected ways we help your business.</h2></div><p>Each service can stand on its own, but the strongest results happen when planning, support, infrastructure, networking, and security work together.</p></div>
<div class="grid grid-3">
<a class="card service-card" href="/consulting"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 18-8-4-8 4 8-18z"></path><path d="M12 3v14"></path></svg></span><h3>Strategic Technology Consulting</h3><p>Roadmaps, assessments, vCIO advisory, project planning, modernization strategy, and vendor guidance.</p><span class="learn">View Consulting →</span></a>
<a class="card service-card" href="/managed-services"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><path d="M5 13h3v6H5zM16 13h3v6h-3z"></path><path d="M16 19a4 4 0 0 1-4 2"></path></svg></span><h3>Managed Technology Services</h3><p>Ongoing support, monitoring, patching, endpoint management, user assistance, cloud productivity support, and documentation.</p><span class="learn">View Managed Services →</span></a>
<a class="card service-card" href="/infrastructure"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.5 19H8a5 5 0 1 1 1.1-9.9A6 6 0 0 1 20 12.5 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 17.5 19z"></path></svg></span><h3>Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</h3><p>Secure, scalable systems across servers, virtualization, business applications, cloud platforms, backups, and hybrid environments.</p><span class="learn">View Infrastructure →</span></a>
<a class="card service-card" href="/network-services"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M10.8 7.2L6.2 16.8M13.2 7.2l4.6 9.6M7.5 19h9"></path></svg></span><h3>Network Services</h3><p>Reliable wired, wireless, VPN, firewall, switching, segmentation, cabling, and network monitoring solutions.</p><span class="learn">View Network Services →</span></a>
<a class="card service-card" href="/cybersecurity"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Cybersecurity Services</h3><p>Security assessments, MFA, endpoint protection, account security, backup planning, monitoring, and incident readiness.</p><span class="learn">View Cybersecurity →</span></a>
<div class="card service-card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Technology Reviews</h3><p>Not sure where to start? We can evaluate your environment, identify priorities, and recommend a practical path forward.</p><a class="learn" href="/quote-request">Request a Review →</a></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band">
<div class="container">
<div class="kicker">
<h4>Start with the business need</h4>
</div>
<h2>
      You do not need to know which technology service to request.
    </h2>
<p>
      Tell us what is not working, what your business is trying to
      accomplish, or where you need greater confidence. Bleufoot can
      review the situation, identify the relevant service areas, and
      help define a practical next step.
    </p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="/quote-request">
        Request a Technology Review →
      </a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact">
        Ask a Question
      </a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
